    "text": "By Guest Contributor ,\n2 days ago Alexandria, Virginia, isn’t just participating in the sustainable fashion movement—it’s shaping it. In a city known for its historic charm, a new style narrative is taking hold, one defined by vintage finds, thrifted gems, and a growing commitment to conscious consumption. Here, getting dressed is as much about storytelling as it is about sustainability. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
